   "evidence": "National capital with communal police commissariats and sub-commissariats in every commune; arrests, detention and dispute handling are by PNC and the courts. Kuluna gangs are widespread (notably in Kisenso, Selembao and Mont Ngafula hillside neighbourhoods) and periodically targeted by police crackdowns (e.g. 'Likofi'-style operations, 2023-2025 kuluna arrests and transfers to Kaniama-Kasese), but they do not hold neighbourhoods against a permanent police presence. Based on background knowledge; no live sources retrieved.",
